<title>USA: Echlin Inc Q2 Feb 28 net flat.</title>
<headline>Echlin Inc Q2 Feb 28 net flat.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Feb 28, 1997	  Feb 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales		     $842,219,000	  $735,902,000</p>
<p> Net income			23,601,000	    23,554,000</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding  62,409,000	    61,918,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share		    0.38		    0.38</p>
<p>						Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Feb 28, 1997	  Feb 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    1,693,127,000	 1,449,669,000</p>
<p> Net income			61,718,000	    57,227,000</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding  62,377,000	    61,884,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share		    0.99		    0.92</p>
<p>NOTE: The First Call consensus estimate for the second quarter was $0.38 per share.</p>
<p>Data from September 1, 1996 forward include Iroquois Tool Systems Inc, which was acquired as a pooling of interests in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
